  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 18cc15594cda44341b1e256a21498e8d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1753624969}
  badEndingLines:
  - 'Apolaki: Mark my words; my remaining servants here will make quick work of you.
    You do not deserve stewardship over yourselves!'
  - Outraged and humiliated, Apolaki retreats to the realm of the Gods.
  - Steve, having defeated the deity, breathes a sigh of relief.
  - The lands are free of tyranny... or so it seems.
  goodEndingLines:
  - 'Apolaki: I understand now why Tambanokano and Markupo chose you to be their
    master.'
  - Apolaki acknowledges your strength of will and of character.
  - The deity bestows a blessing upon you and returns to the realm of the Gods, entrusting
    you with stewardiship over the mortal realm.
  - Steve, having been given the ultimate responsibility, whimpers under the weight
    of his newfound standing.
  - The mortal realm is safe... for now.
  currentLines:
  - current 1
  - current 2
  - current 3
  textInterval: 0.03
  pointer: {fileID: 1495265774}
  HUD: {fileID: 532541007}
  bbSkill: {fileID: 0}
